  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hé ! T’es sur un tournage, là !\nDécale-toi un peu !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800E90020002100200054201900650073002000730075007200200075006E00200074006F00750072006E006100670065002C0020006C00E000200021000A004400E900630061006C0065002D0074006F006900200075006E00200070006500750020002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Attends ! C’est un Méga-Anneau que je vois\nà ton bras ? T’es un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe Dresseu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁrse ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Moi, je suis réalisateur, et pas des moindres.\nJe suis incroyablement connu... dans le métier.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je réalise une trilogie sur les Pokémon\nsauvages d’Illumis, et je filme avec<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nun Motismart pour un max de réalisme !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 123
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le premier Pokémon que j’ai choisi est un célèbre\nprédateur marin capable de déchiqueter ses proies<U+0010><U+0001>븀\navec ses crocs acérés : Carvanha !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 142
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais je vais être franc avec toi. Travailler avec\nun Pokémon sauvage, c’est bien sur le papier,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nmais dans les faits...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 126
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est ultra dangereux !!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043201900650073007400200075006C007400720061002000640061006E006700650072006500750078002000210021002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est pourquoi je préfèrerais tourner avec\nle Pokémon de quelqu’un à la place.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’aurais pas un Carvanha, à tout hasard ?\nSi oui, je t’en supplie, laisse-moi le filmer !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si tu veux bien me laisser filmer ton Carvanha,\najoute-le à ton équipe et reviens me voir !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bon, ça tourne ou pas ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006F006E002C002000E7006100200074006F00750072006E00650020006F007500200070006100730020003F00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai un de ces tracs...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A20190061006900200075006E0020006400650020006300650073002000740072006100630073002E002E002E00100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, tu veux bien que je filme ton Carvanha ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C002000740075002000760065007500780020006200690065006E00200071007500650020006A0065002000660069006C006D006500200074006F006E002000430061007200760061006E006800610020003F00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Avec grand plaisir !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410076006500630020006700720061006E006400200070006C00610069007300690072002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai besoin d’y réfléchir...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A2019006100690020006200650073006F0069006E00200064201900790020007200E90066006C00E90063006800690072002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allez, s’il te plaît !\nC’est rémunéré, en plus !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C0065007A002C0020007320190069006C00200074006500200070006C006100EE007400200021000A004320190065007300740020007200E9006D0075006E00E9007200E9002C00200065006E00200070006C007500730020002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Super ! On est au complet !\nAllez, ça tourne !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530075007000650072002000210020004F006E002000650073007400200061007500200063006F006D0070006C0065007400200021000A0041006C006C0065007A002C002000E7006100200074006F00750072006E00650020002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK, on passe à la scène suivante !\nPrêts... Action !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F004B002C0020006F006E002000700061007300730065002000E00020006C006100200073006300E8006E0065002000730075006900760061006E0074006500200021000A0050007200EA00740073002E002E002E00200041006300740069006F006E0020002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh non, le voilà !\nC’est le terrible Carvanha !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680020006E006F006E002C0020006C006500200076006F0069006C00E000200021000A004320190065007300740020006C00650020007400650072007200690062006C0065002000430061007200760061006E006800610020002100100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "À moi ! Je suis en péril !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C00020006D006F0069002000210020004A00650020007300750069007300200065006E0020007000E900720069006C0020002100100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nha...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E00680061002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Coupez !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F007500700065007A0020002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Carvanha, t’as pas lu le script ou quoi ?\nFaut les attaquer, là !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430061007200760061006E00680061002C0020007420190061007300200070006100730020006C00750020006C006500200073006300720069007000740020006F0075002000710075006F00690020003F000A00460061007500740020006C00650073002000610074007400610071007500650072002C0020006C00E00020002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "N-nha...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E002D006E00680061002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Euh, m’sieur... Je viens de faire une recherche\nvite fait sur les Carvanha...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... et apparemment, ils deviennent carrément\npeureux quand ils sont tout seuls.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quoi ?! Mais comment je vais faire pour filmer\nma scène, moi ?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00510075006F00690020003F00210020004D00610069007300200063006F006D006D0065006E00740020006A00650020007600610069007300200066006100690072006500200070006F00750072002000660069006C006D00650072000A006D006100200073006300E8006E0065002C0020006D006F00690020003F002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quoique... un Carvanha qui a peur des êtres\nhumains... Hmmm...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00510075006F0069007100750065002E002E002E00200075006E002000430061007200760061006E00680061002000710075006900200061002000700065007500720020006400650073002000EA0074007200650073000A00680075006D00610069006E0073002E002E002E00200048006D006D006D002E002E002E00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On tient peut-être quelque chose !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E0020007400690065006E007400200070006500750074002D00EA0074007200650020007100750065006C007100750065002000630068006F007300650020002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’était pas ce que j’avais prévu à la base, mais\nje pense que ça fera un bon moment de cinéma !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un Carvanha qui a peur des êtres humains...\nC’est pas banal, ça peut faire un bon moment<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nde cinéma !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 108
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’suis bien content qu’on ait bouclé le tournage\nde cette scène !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A201900730075006900730020006200690065006E00200063006F006E00740065006E00740020007100752019006F006E002000610069007400200062006F00750063006C00E90020006C006500200074006F00750072006E006100670065000A0064006500200063006500740074006500200073006300E8006E00650020002100100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je ne pensais pas que les Carvanha pouvaient\nêtre aussi chou !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020006E0065002000700065006E0073006100690073002000700061007300200071007500650020006C00650073002000430061007200760061006E0068006100200070006F00750076006100690065006E0074000A00EA007400720065002000610075007300730069002000630068006F00750020002100100002011401960000",
